  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc14:2.2.4": "Sp-yoj 2.112: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Cammakhaṇḍoti ettha cammaṁyeva ante khaṇḍattā chinnattā cammakhaṇḍoti vuccati</i>, “Here <i lang='pi' translate='no'>cammakhaṇḍa</i> is just a hide. Because it is cut up within and made of pieces, it called a <i lang='pi' translate='no'>cammakhaṇḍa</i>.” For the meaning of <i lang='pi' translate='no'>cimilikā</i>, “a mat underlay”, see Appendix of Furniture. ",
